    "detailed_description": "On this charming animal-themed chessboard, take turns activating pieces with opponents, utilizing each animal's distinct abilities to secure victories in every battle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785070/extras/5381ee0d7bc145ab9fc69392a1dc0d5d.avif?t=1707382664\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br>In each turn, prioritize strategic activation sequences, select targets sensibly, find appropriate positions, and avoid getting surrounded. Additionally, be prepared for unexpected team combinations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785070/extras/4805c6273c3841c1d61454ecb1f999da.avif?t=1707382664\" data-has-big width=800 height=402 /></span><br>Compose a team from over 50 species of unique animals.<br>Navigate through a series of continuous levels, encountering advantages and disadvantages based on the terrain and animal combinations.<br>Beware of rabbits and mice! They might bring unexpected outcomes...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785070/extras/8c32e2ec907da1739605f5197b989787.avif?t=1707382664\" width=800 height=624 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785070/extras/386fbc6e95b2d302f7643a325bbdc299.avif?t=1707382664\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>",
